        "text_y4p3en": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Glocalme KeyTracker uses Cloud SiM technology for global location services, supporting 6 types of location technology including GPS, AGPS, LBS, Bluetooth, WiFi, and active radar.<br/> The multi-network and multi-base station technology improves base station positioning accuracy when GPS and WiFi signals are unavailable, addressing large positioning deviation.</p>",
