          }
        },
        "text_q4p3Xn": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Traditional trackers often struggle in complex environments within the last 100 meters. But not ours! Our innovative active radar search feature guides you to your target even without GPS. With our tracker, you'll find what you're looking for no matter how challenging the terrain.</p>",
